    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακί̄ν-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shifting: motion</i> in space, e.g. of rotation about an
			axis, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ πᾶς αν μ., ἐν πάσῃ
			μ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Autol.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristarch.Sam.
				1
			</span></i>; <i>dislocation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφονδύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.269
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
