					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					892a27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐς τὸ βαρβαρικώτερον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.8.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
